  "mainHtml": "<main class=\"bg-white\"><div class=\"bg-off-white\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-1 mb-8 pt-8 lg:mb-16 breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/de/questions\">Häufige Frage</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><a href=\"/de/question_categories/payment\">Zahlungen</a><i class=\"icon\">chevron_right</i><span>How do payments and fees work?</span></div><div class=\"lg:flex gap-16 mb-16\"><div class=\"lg:w-3/4\"><h1 class=\"font-serif text-5xl mb-8\">How do payments and fees work?</h1><div class=\"bg-white rounded-lg p-8 auction-body\"><p><strong>A (short version):</strong></p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Handling fee:</strong> SEK 2,995 (incl. VAT). Invoiced when your auction is approved for\n  publication or at the time of publication.</li>\n  <li><strong>Seller's fee:</strong> 2.5% (incl. VAT) of the hammer price. Invoiced only if the auction results\n  in a sale.</li>\n  <li><strong>Buyer's fee:</strong> 7.5% (incl. VAT) of the hammer price. Invoiced to the buyer upon a\n  successful sale.</li>\n  <li><strong>Vehicle payment:</strong> 100% of the hammer price goes to the seller. Payment is settled\n  directly between buyer and seller.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Example:</strong> Hammer price SEK 200,000 -&gt; the seller receives SEK 200,000 from the buyer.\nThe buyer is invoiced 7.5% (SEK 15,000). The seller is invoiced 2.5% (SEK 5,000). (All percentages\nabove <strong>include VAT</strong>.)</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:w-1/4 mt-8 lg:mt-0\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-6\">Kategorien</h2><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2 lg:block\"><li><a href=\"/de/questions\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Alle</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/buying\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Einkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/selling\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verkaufen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/bidding\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Bieten</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/documentation\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Dokumentation</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/account\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Konto</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/payment\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent px-2 border-black! text-black! hover:text-black!\">Zahlungen</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/shipping\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Transport</a></li><li><a href=\"/de/question_categories/verification\" class=\"block lg:px-4 lg:py-3 font-semibold text-neutral-500 hover:text-neutral-600 transition-colors border rounded border-transparent\">Verifizierung</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 pb-16\"><div class=\"w-full p-8 bg-amber-100 rounded sm:flex justify-between items-center\"><div><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl sm:text-4xl mb-4\">Weitere Fragen?</h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base mb-2 sm:mb-8\">Sie können uns eine E-Mail senden. Wir helfen Ihnen gerne weiter!</p><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"font-bold underline hover:text-neutral-800\">support@biddershighway.com</a></div><a href=\"mailto:support@biddershighway.com\" class=\"hidden sm:block\"><img src=\"/assets/contact-us-4411369c.svg\" alt=\"Contact us\" class=\"w-48 h-36\"></a></div></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center py-8\"><a href=\"/de\" class=\"inline-block rounded-sm cursor-pointer transition-colors px-4 py-2 text-white bg-jaffa hover:bg-zest disabled:bg-yellow-700 disabled:text-neutral-300 px-6 py-3\">Alle unsere Autoauktionen ansehen</a></div></div></main>",
